{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/6f74c947e74cf9bbe3a56cd7dbe7a88c.poster.avif?t=1774764553\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/6f74c947e74cf9bbe3a56cd7dbe7a88c.webm?t=1774764553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/6f74c947e74cf9bbe3a56cd7dbe7a88c.mp4?t=1774764553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diatonic is a rhythm roguelike where your piano becomes the controller. Play with a MIDI keyboard to test your sight-reading or tackle each song as a typing game on your computer keyboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomized Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new songs by turning them into roguelike runs - sections of the song become different levels to make learning easier and more fun. Each run features randomized levels for a fresh experience every time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn Naturally</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re new to piano or experienced, Diatonic helps sharpen your piano skills. Play along with sheet music-style notes to naturally practice sight-reading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a real MIDI keyboard (any size!) for the most authentic experience. You can also use a computer keyboard for a typing game, a controller, or the on-screen piano with mouse/touch controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/513fd2a81f66519ec7d589873a41ab09.poster.avif?t=1774764553\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/513fd2a81f66519ec7d589873a41ab09.webm?t=1774764553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/513fd2a81f66519ec7d589873a41ab09.mp4?t=1774764553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 20+ songs included with game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load custom MIDI files to play your own songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice treble clef, bass clef, or both together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your own pace: speed up or slow down the tempo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn with a mode that waits until you play the correct note</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports sharps, flats, and all key signatures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978490?t=1774764553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/64dbba45d4ae6ab64141797deefd2b2758e80cfe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774764553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/36993e287149d7b1fabb0c1e209b96636d7c2347/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774764553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/36993e287149d7b1fabb0c1e209b96636d7c2347/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774764553","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/6f74c947e74cf9bbe3a56cd7dbe7a88c.poster.avif?t=1774764553\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/6f74c947e74cf9bbe3a56cd7dbe7a88c.webm?t=1774764553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/6f74c947e74cf9bbe3a56cd7dbe7a88c.mp4?t=1774764553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diatonic is a rhythm roguelike where your piano becomes the controller. Play with a MIDI keyboard to test your sight-reading or tackle each song as a typing game on your computer keyboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomized Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new songs by turning them into roguelike runs - sections of the song become different levels to make learning easier and more fun. Each run features randomized levels for a fresh experience every time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn Naturally</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re new to piano or experienced, Diatonic helps sharpen your piano skills. Play along with sheet music-style notes to naturally practice sight-reading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a real MIDI keyboard (any size!) for the most authentic experience. You can also use a computer keyboard for a typing game, a controller, or the on-screen piano with mouse/touch controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/513fd2a81f66519ec7d589873a41ab09.poster.avif?t=1774764553\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/513fd2a81f66519ec7d589873a41ab09.webm?t=1774764553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/extras/513fd2a81f66519ec7d589873a41ab09.mp4?t=1774764553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 20+ songs included with game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load custom MIDI files to play your own songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice treble clef, bass clef, or both together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your own pace: speed up or slow down the tempo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn with a mode that waits until you play the correct note</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports sharps, flats, and all key signatures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nonzero Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/37fc27c640fffbbf08e12b65e00c8a2aa11b1d74/header.jpg?t=1774764553","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11.7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://vid